sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User [S1]
    participant B as Browser UI [S2]
    participant M as SessionAuthMiddleware [S3]
    participant T as SessionStore [S4]
    participant C as MVC / ApprovalsController [S5]
    participant D as ApprovalService [S6]
    participant R as InMemoryInvoiceRepository [S7]

    Note over U,R: Scope: approve one invoice - sign-in precedes approval - invoice may be seeded pending or submitted from Draft [S8]
    U->>B: Click Approve for a pending invoice [S9]
    B->>M: POST /api/approvals/{id}/approve, JSON {}, Bearer token [S10]
    M->>T: Get(token) - null if missing or unrecognized [S11]
    T-->>M: UserSession or null [S11]
    alt No valid session [S12]
        M-->>B: 401 Unauthorized, no response body [S12]
        Note over B: api() signs out if local session exists - throws error [S12]
    else Valid session [S13]
        M->>C: Store session in HttpContext.Items - continue pipeline [S13]
        Note over C: RequireRole.OnActionExecuting checks Approver or Admin [S14]
        alt Role not allowed [S14]
            C-->>B: 403 Forbidden [S14]
        else Role allowed [S15]
            C->>D: Handle calls Approve(id, session.Username) [S15]
            D->>R: Find calls GetById(id) [S16]
            R-->>D: Invoice or null [S16]
            alt Invoice not found [S17]
                D-->>C: KeyNotFoundException [S17]
                C-->>B: Handle maps to 404 with error JSON [S17]
            else Status is not PendingApproval [S18]
                D-->>C: EnsurePending throws InvalidOperationException [S18]
                C-->>B: Handle maps to 409 with error JSON [S18]
            else PendingApproval [S19]
                D->>D: Set Approved, DecidedBy, DecidedAt = UTC now [S19]
                D->>R: Update(invoice) [S20]
                R-->>D: Return from in-memory update [S20]
                D-->>C: Updated invoice [S21]
                C-->>B: Handle returns 200 with invoice JSON [S21]
                Note over B: refresh() sends authenticated GET /api/invoices -<br/>renders all invoices and filters pending list locally [S22]
            end
        end
    end
    Note over B: decide() catches request or refresh errors -<br/>sets decision-error - 401 sign-out hides app view [S23]
